flowchart TD
    U[User natural-language request] --> CLI[CLI]
    U --> UI[Streamlit dashboard form]
    UI --> CLI_ORCH[create_playlist orchestrator]
    CLI --> CLI_ORCH
    CLI_ORCH --> GI[Gemini intent interpreter]
    GI --> PV{Schema and semantic validation}
    GI -. API error or invalid JSON .-> FB[Local keyword fallback]
    FB --> PV
    PV --> PF[Validated PreferenceProfile]
    PF --> SE[Python scoring engine]
    CSV[(Local synthetic songs.csv)] --> CV{CSV range and type guardrails}
    RCSV[(Optional real_songs.csv, built once)] --> CV
    BLD[build_real_catalog.py: ReccoBeats features + Deezer covers, filters, derived mood] -. one-time, reviewed by a person .-> RCSV
    CV --> SE
    SE --> PG[Playlist generator]
    PG --> DV[Artist diversity and energy-curve ordering]
    DV --> GX[Gemini explanation service]
    GX --> EV{Selected-ID coverage validation}
    GX -. API error or invalid output .-> DR[Deterministic score reasons]
    EV --> OUT[Ordered playlist and warnings]
    DR --> OUT
    OUT --> SC{Dashboard system checks: catalog IDs, uniqueness, length, determinism}
    SC --> MEDIA[Cards, covers, Spotify links and sourced notes from catalog fields; previews fetched fresh]
    MEDIA --> HR[Human review / listener choice]
    OUT --> HR
    OUT --> TEST[Automated tests and offline evaluation]
